rse com o servidor sem perder desempenho."}</p><section className="welcome-chips"><span><Icon name="zap" size={12} /> Interface leve</span><span><Icon name="radio" size={12} /> Baixa latência</span><span><Icon name="shield" size={12} /> Dados locais</span></section></div><div className="date-divider"><span>24 de agosto de 2026</span></div>{currentMessages.map((message) => <MessageItem key={message.id} message={message} onReply={() => setReplying(message.author)} onReact={(emoji) => react(message.id, emoji)} />)}</div>
+            <div ref={messageScrollRef} className="message-scroll" onScroll={(event) => { const area = event.currentTarget; stickToBottomRef.current = area.scrollHeight - area.scrollTop - area.clientHeight < 120; }}><div className="channel-welcome"><div><Icon name="hash" size={28} /></div><h1>Bem-vindo a #{channel.label}</h1><p>{channel.id === "geral" ? "O ponto de encontro do esquadrão. Organize a jogatina sem distração." : "Converse com o servidor sem perder desempenho."}</p><section className="welcome-chips"><span><Icon name="zap" size={12} /> Interface leve</span><span><Icon name="radio" size={12} /> Baixa latência</span><span><Icon name="shield" size={12} /> Dados sincronizados</span></section></div><div className="date-divider"><span>24 de agosto de 2026</span></div>{currentMessages.map((message) => <MessageItem key={message.id} message={message} onReply={() => setReplying(message.author)} onReact={(emoji) => react(message.id, emoji)} />)}</div>
             <div className="composer-wrap">
               {replying && <div className="replying">Respondendo a <strong>@{replying}</strong><button onClick={() => setReplying(null)} aria-label="Cancelar resposta"><Icon name="x" size={14} /></button></div>}
               {floatingPanel === "emoji" && <div id="emoji-picker" className="composer-popover emoji-picker floating-panel" data-floating-root role="dialog" aria-label="Selecionar emoji">{emojis.map((emoji) => <button type="button" key={emoji} aria-label={`Inserir ${emoji}`} onClick={() => insertEmoji(emoji)}>{emoji}</button>)}</div>}
               {floatingPanel === "gif" && <div id="gif-popover" className="composer-popover gif-popover floating-panel" data-floating-root role="status"><strong>GIFs em breve</strong><p>A integração ainda não está disponível nesta versão leve.</p></div>}
               <form className="composer" onSubmit={sendMessage}>
                 <button type="button" aria-label="Anexar arquivo — em breve" data-tooltip="Em breve" onClick={() => showSoon("Anexos")}><Icon name="plus" size={19} /></button>
-                <textarea ref={composerRef} rows={1} maxLength={MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH} value={draft} onChange={(event) => setDraft(event.target.value.slice(0, MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH))} onKeyDown={handleComposerKeyDown} placeholder={`Conversar em #${channel.label}`} aria-label={`Mensagem para ${channel.label}`} aria-describedby={draft.length >= COUNTER_START ? "message-counter" : undefined} />
+                <textarea ref={composerRef} rows={1} maxLength={MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH} value={draft} onChange={(event) => { setDraft(event.target.value.slice(0, MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH)); event.currentTarget.style.height = "0px"; event.currentTarget.style.height = `${Math.min(event.currentTarget.scrollHeight, 160)}px`; event.currentTarget.style.overflowY = event.currentTarget.scrollHeight > 160 ? "auto" : "hidden"; }} onKeyDown={handleComposerKeyDown} placeholder={`Conversar em #${channel.label}`} aria-label={`Mensagem para ${channel.label}`} aria-describedby={draft.length >= COUNTER_START ? "message-counter" : undefined} />
                 <button type="button" className="gif-button" aria-label="Abrir GIFs" aria-expanded={floatingPanel === "gif"} aria-controls="gif-popover" data-panel-trigger data-tooltip="GIFs" onClick={(event) => openFloatingPanel("gif", event.currentTarget)}>GIF</button>
                 <button type="button" aria-label="Abrir seletor de emoji" aria-expanded={floatingPanel === "emoji"} aria-controls="emoji-picker" data-panel-trigger data-tooltip="Emoji" onClick={(event) => openFloatingPanel("emoji", event.currentTarget)}><Icon name="smile" size={19} /></button>
                 <button className="send-button" type="submit" aria-label="Enviar mensagem" disabled={!draft.trim()}><Icon name="send" size={17} /></button>
               </form>
               <div className="composer-help"><small>Enter para enviar • Shift+Enter para nova linha • rascunho local</small>{draft.length >= COUNTER_START && <strong id="message-counter" className={draft.length === MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH ? "at-limit" : ""} aria-live="polite">{draft.length}/{MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH}</strong>}</div>
             </div>
-          </> : channel.type === "voice" ? <VoiceRoom roomName={channel.label} profile={profile} audio={audio} onAudioChange={saveAudio} onToast={setToast} /> : <LfgBoard profile={profile} onToast={setToast} />}
+          </> : channel.type === "voice" ? <VoiceRoom roomName={channel.label} roomId={`${activeServer}:${channel.id}`} profile={profile} audio={audio} onAudioChange={saveAudio} onToast={setToast} /> : <LfgBoard profile={profile} onToast={setToast} />}
         </div>
 
         <aside className="member-panel" id="members-panel" data-floating-root aria-label="Lista de membros" hidden={!membersOpen}>
           <div className="member-panel-title"><strong>Membros</strong><button aria-label="Fechar lista de membros" data-tooltip="Fechar" onClick={() => closeMembers(true)}><Icon name="x" size={15} /></button></div>
-          <div className="member-heading"><span>MEMBROS — {server.members.length}</span><button ref={memberSearchButtonRef} aria-label={memberSearchOpen ? "Fechar pesquisa de membros" : "Pesquisar membros"} aria-expanded={memberSearchOpen} aria-controls="member-search-input" data-panel-trigger data-tooltip="Pesquisar membros" onClick={() => { setSelectedMember(null); if (memberSearchOpen) closeMemberSearch(true); else { setMemberQuery(""); setMemberSearchOpen(true); } }}><Icon name="search" size={15} /></button></div>
+          <div className="member-heading"><span>MEMBROS — {profileRows.length}</span><button ref={memberSearchButtonRef} aria-label={memberSearchOpen ? "Fechar pesquisa de membros" : "Pesquisar membros"} aria-expanded={memberSearchOpen} aria-controls="member-search-input" data-panel-trigger data-tooltip="Pesquisar membros" onClick={() => { setSelectedMember(null); if (memberSearchOpen) closeMemberSearch(true); else { setMemberQuery(""); setMemberSearchOpen(true); } }}><Icon name="search" size={15} /></button></div>
           {memberSearchOpen && <div className="member-search" data-floating-root><Icon name="search" size={14} /><input id="member-search-input" autoFocus value={memberQuery} onChange={(event) => setMemberQuery(event.target.value)} aria-label="Pesquisar membros por nome ou jogo" placeholder="Nome ou jogo" /><button aria-label="Limpar pesquisa de membros" onClick={() => setMemberQuery("")}><Icon name